"我们。我们会尽快回复您。&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;"

#. module: beauty_parlor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beauty_parlor.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr "想和我们讨论您的 Odoo 配置，或更进一步吗？"

#. module: beauty_parlor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beauty_parlor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr "您可以在主仪表板上访问 Odoo 数据库中已安装的每个应用。"

#. module: beauty_parlor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beauty_parlor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can also configure an email alias so everyone sending email to this one "
"will create a new\n"
"                  opportunity for you."
msgstr ""
"您还可以配置电子邮件别名，这样任何向该别名发送邮件的人都会为您创建一条新商"
"机。"

#. module: beauty_parlor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beauty_parlor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can set the consultation with an upfront online payment. Activate it in "
"your Appointment Type\n"
"                  Settings by setting up an upfront payment method."
msgstr "您可以为咨询设置在线预付款。在预约类型设置中设置预付款方式即可启用。"

#. module: beauty_parlor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beauty_parlor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade your Beauty\n"
"                  Parlor package and check the related box."
msgstr ""
"您没有导入演示数据？现在仍可以导入。前往应用 &gt; 行业 &gt; 升级您的美容院套"
"餐，并勾选相关选项。"

